  (no_connect (at 111.76 104.14) (uuid "7c191cc1-000c-4177-8011-31a75f52b3cd"))
  (text "LM76003 tracking pre-regulator: VPRE = VOUT + 1.5 V (2 V ... 27.5 V)"
    (at 16.51 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "529f200c-4d1d-4156-b232-bb7b992d8b1b")
  )
  (text "VPRE = VFB (1 + R201/R202) + (VFB - V_BUCK_DAC) R201/R203,  VFB = 1.006 V\nBUCK_DAC 0.2 V -> 27.5 V;  1.0 V -> 2.0 V;  ~25 mV per G474 DAC step.\nMCU in reset: PA4 is high-impedance -> no injection -> VPRE = 2.0 V (safe default).\nFirmware rule: VPRE = measured VOUT + 1.5 V; raise VPRE before VOUT, lower VOUT before VPRE."
    (at 20.32 45.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a5003fdb-6b4a-4379-95c1-1886a25ed47d")
  )
  (text "RT open = 500 kHz.  SYNC/MODE high = forced PWM (VPRE can be pulled down).\nBIAS from +3V3 (VPRE leaves the 3.3-18 V BIAS range).  SS/TRK open = internal soft start.\nU201 footprint: TI RNP0030B (WQFN-30, 6 x 4 mm) is not in the KiCad library;\nimport it from TI or LCSC/EasyEDA (C470958).  LM76005 (5 A) is pin-compatible."
    (at 220.98 129.54 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "56ffe29c-2da3-4204-9945-f086549e0a15")
  )
  (text "Optional gate-drive charge pump V_GATE = VIN + 10 V (not fitted)"
    (at 16.51 147.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "082ad0fa-fc3c-480e-85d6-3d23f776ef2c")
  )
  (text "Fit to raise the maximum output from ~24 V to ~27 V:\nfit R208, C215, D201-D203, C216 and R315 (linear sheet),\nremove R314."
    (at 170.18 177.8 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "cbfae45a-dbe6-4f98-a444-c61f9703ef4a")
  )
